<title>NETHERLANDS: Besi Q1 profit falls sharply.</title>
<headline>Besi Q1 profit falls sharply.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-05-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>First quarter to March 31, 1997</p>
<p>(in millions of guilders unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>    Net per shr (guilders)	     0.15 vs   0.47</p>
<p>    Net profit			     4.08 vs  12.40</p>
<p>    Turnover			     104.39 vs 127.04</p>
<p>    Operating profit		     6.14 vs  19.40</p>
<p>    Interest charges		     0.56 vs   0.65</p>
<p>    Tax					1.67 vs   6.49</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name is BE Semiconductor Industries NV.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
